egm-claude-code
Claude Code packaging of the Elephant-Goldfish Model (EGM).

plugins/egm/ contains files from google/elephant-goldfish-model
(https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model), Copyright 2026 Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This repository modifies those files as follows (applied by
scripts/sync_upstream.py, and marked "egm-claude-code overlay" in each file):
  * agents/*.md (reviewer personas): adds the frontmatter keys `tools`,
    `model`, and `omitClaudeMd`.
  * skills/*/SKILL.md: adds a Claude Code note after the frontmatter; skill
    folders are renamed to each skill's frontmatter `name`.
  * Adds docs/claude-code.md and .claude-plugin/plugin.json.
  * Leaves out upstream test fixtures (TEST.md, test_scenarios.yaml).

This is not an official Google or Anthropic product.
